      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Ulagalantha Perumal\nThayaar: Amudavalli Thayaar\nVimanam: Sarasreekara Vimanam\nPushkarani: Naga Theertham\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nTirumazhisai Azhwar: 2 Pasurams\nTirumangai Azhwar: 4 Pasurams\nTotal: 6 Pasurams",
